WEBVTT

00:06:30.038 --> 00:06:32.746
even when all the evidence
points us the other way?

00:06:33.704 --> 00:06:36.663
The most common answer, people
give sunk costs,

00:06:37.454 --> 00:06:39.371
we've already invested our time or money,

00:06:39.538 --> 00:06:42.788
and we want to do everything in our power
to get a return on that investment,

00:06:43.371 --> 00:06:45.371
just like a Lexus at fire festival.

00:06:46.413 --> 00:06:48.496
Sunk costs are part of a story,

00:06:49.121 --> 00:06:53.246
but decades of research show that the most
powerful forces aren't economic,

00:06:53.704 --> 00:06:55.038
they're emotional.

00:06:55.579 --> 00:07:02.871
Escalation is where people make errors
because of their ego and their emotions.